 <section class="planner-page"><div class="container planner-page-grid"><div class="planner-intro"><span class="hero-pill">🍍 LET'S MAKE MEMORIES</span><h1>Your dream trip, <em>your kind of magic.</em></h1><p>From blue-water beaches to tea-covered hills, every unforgettable adventure begins with a little inspiration.</p><div class="planner-art"><img src="/images/brand/tropical-hero.svg" alt="Illustrated Sri Lanka tropical beach" /></div><div class="planner-trust">✓ No online payment · ✓ No account required · ✓ Personal response by WhatsApp</div></div><PlanWizard/></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
